{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301200","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130120001:1":{"text":"뭐, 어디 탐험하러 가지 않았을까요?","source_cn":"也许是出去探险，谁知道呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x431C03C10B1CCC1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130120002:1":{"text":"소렌 오빠와 아르사 언니가 근처에 있는 짐승을 전부 정리해서 걱정은 안 돼요.","source_cn":"附近的野兽都被索恩哥哥和阿尔萨姐姐清理干净，所以不需要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4501E163F6B1EECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130120003:1":{"text":"요즘은 오히려 식사 준비 때문에 골치가 아프다니까요.","source_cn":"相比之下，我更头疼最近的饭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6C5081E27DF400F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130120004:1":{"text":"조금 만들면 모자라고, 많이 만들면 남고... 에잇, 밥이 남는 것보단 모자란 게 나으니까, 그냥 적게 만들어야겠어요.","source_cn":"做的少了不够吃，做的多了又剩下……算了，宁可做少些也好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA01662BA093DBB8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血蕾拉妮":{"text":"레일라니","source":"小蛮血蕾拉妮","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}